  campfire join <room>       join a room someone has lit
  campfire light <room>      light a new room for others to join
  campfire list              see which fires are burning nearby
  campfire --name Sam join   pick a display name (or set CAMPFIRE_NAME)
  campfire version           show which version you have
  campfire update            download and install the newest version
  campfire rm                uninstall campfire from this Mac

Inside a room, type to send a spark. Type /help to see all commands.
"""
